    "ki_c482ef81284e4a73": {
      "knowledge_item_id": "ki_c482ef81284e4a73",
      "source_reference": {
        "source_id": "yt_74ab96e1f377",
        "source_type": "YOUTUBE_VIDEO",
        "source_url": null,
        "source_title": "Serum 2 for Absolute Beginners (Guide)",
        "segment_ids": [
          "seg_0149",
          "seg_0150",
          "seg_0151",
          "seg_0152",
          "seg_0153",
          "seg_0154",
          "seg_0155"
        ],
        "start_time_sec": 401.24,
        "end_time_sec": 426.319
      },
      "original_proposition": "itself. You can also reorder the effects signal chain by clicking and dragging, which can drastically change the sound in some cases. And finally, we can load or save presets for individual effects or the effects chain as a whole. [Music]",
      "knowledge_type": "OBSERVATION",
      "epistemic_status": "SOURCE_REPORTED",
      "normalized_proposition": "itself. You can also reorder the effects signal chain by clicking and dragging, which can drastically change the sound in some cases. And finally, we can load or save presets for individual effects or the effects chain as a whole.",
