      "epistemic_status": "SOURCE_REPORTED",
      "normalized_proposition": "Finally, it's also worth mentioning you can save and load LFO presets. In Serum, we also have velocity modulation, which lets you use your notes velocity, how hard a keyboard is pressed, for example, as a modulation",
