      "original_proposition": "[Music] We can also doubleclick to enter values manually. Useful for pitch, for example. Some elements of the UI can be configured in the global tab, including turning on tool tips, which can be very handy for explaining what things do when you hover over them, as well as if there's something modulating them. This global tab also gives you access to Serum's advanced voicing controls.",
